      "Internal stage values come from a smaller post-canonical diagnostic sample and never contribute to the official E2E trend.",
      "V1 Prefill and Decode are CUDA device-timeline intervals on one FIFO compute stream, so they are additive and sum with host_overhead back to E2E; Decode absorbs device idle inside the Decode stage.",
      "Worker pipeline comes from a separate post-matrix process; formal E2E and post-canonical stage metrics remain unchanged."
    ]
